///1PUT

PUT  Version 1.8 - File Copying Program With User Area Support
  CP/M-86 version by Angus Bliss and Bill Bolton



///2USAGE
Usage:
        PUT [d:]filename f.t [d:] [-NW] <cr>
Where:
        filename - is any valid CP/M-86 file specifier
        f        - is source user area
        t        - is destination user area
        d:       - is optional drive specifier
        -        - is an option flag
        N        - is no query to overwrite existing file
        W        - is force overwrite of R/O file

        Will prompt if destination file is already present.
